# Claude Code (project-level settings are user-specific)
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Third-party skill with its own git history (not tracked here)
skills/fireworks-tech-graph/

# Skill sync state (generated by contentops-core/scripts/sync_skills_to_daena.py)
skills/.sync_state.json

# Daena-Mind vault (user data, generated reports, memory tiers)
data/mind/

# Soul vault (IP-protected, never pushed to GitHub)
backend/app/soul/

# Runtime OAuth overrides (user-pasted OAuth client IDs/secrets)
# Written by POST /settings/oauth-credentials, chmod 0600 on POSIX.
# Contains plaintext client secrets -- never commit.
backend/.daena_oauth_overrides.json

# SQLite dev DB + recovery artifacts.
# The .db itself is ignored; repair-db*.sh can create timestamped
# backup files that we also keep out of git.
backend/daena_dev2.db
backend/daena_dev2.db.*
backend/*.corrupted-backup-*
backend/.llama-server.pid

# docs/ directory -- internal docs live in Doc/ (gitignored)
# Only README.md, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md at root
# docs/assets/ is un-ignored so README images render on GitHub
# docs/pitch/ is un-ignored so investor-facing materials live in repo
# docs/SESSION-LOG.md is un-ignored so the session history is shared
docs/*
!docs/assets/
!docs/pitch/
!docs/SESSION-LOG.md
# LinkedIn compliance rationale -- public-facing product doc explaining
# why Daena never auto-sends on LinkedIn. Shipping in-repo so evaluators
# + open-source contributors can find the reasoning without source-diving.
!docs/LINKEDIN_COMPLIANCE.md
# HackingTool integration audit + policy doc -- public-facing rationale
# for the security-tool denylist. Commits to both Daena + Daena OSS.
!docs/HACKINGTOOL_INTEGRATION.md
# Connections / MCP / Plugins / Runtime rebuild deliverables
# (rebuild-connections-mcp-runtime branch, started 2026-04-30)
!docs/CONNECTIONS_REBUILD_PLAN.md
!docs/CONNECTIONS_MCP_PLUGIN_ARCHITECTURE_V2.md
!docs/CONNECTIONS_CURRENT_DAMAGE_REPORT.md
!docs/CONNECTIONS_FILE_MAP.md
!docs/_explore/
# Ultraview review + ADR-002 founder-locked decisions for the rebuild
!docs/ADR-002-connections-rebuild-locked-decisions.md
!docs/Ultraview/
!docs/Ultraview/**
!docs/_explore/*.md

